WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.096
Long, long ago, in the Song dynasty, there was a famous general whose name was Yue Fei.

00:00:09.446 --> 00:00:16.886
When Yue Fei was young, his mother often taught him that he must be a person loyal to his country.

00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:27.460
One day, his mother picked up a tiny needle and, stitch by stitch, carefully tattooed characters onto Yue Fei's back.

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:37.962
They were four characters: 'Serve the country with utmost loyalty.' His mother hoped he would always remember to serve his country loyally.

00:00:38.312 --> 00:00:48.896
When he grew up, Yue Fei put on shining armor, mounted a tall war horse, and marched bravely to defend his country.

00:00:49.246 --> 00:01:03.310
Many years passed, and the story is still told. Under the warm lamplight, a grandfather tells it to the children, inspiring generation after generation.

